---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PartnerCards from './PartnerCards.astro';
import Pagination from './Pagination.astro';
import {postCategories} from '../lib/content';
const {page}=Astro.props;
---
<Base title={`Resource Partners${page.number>1?` — Page ${page.number}`:''}`} description="Explore independent local business profiles, services and recent project articles in the On Simplicity Resource Partners directory." breadcrumbs={[{name:'Home',path:'/'},{name:'Resource Partners',...(page.number>1?{path:'/resource-partners/'}:{})},...(page.number>1?[{name:`Page ${page.number}`}]:[])]}><header class="page-header"><p class="eyebrow">Local knowledge. Everyday help.</p><h1>Resource Partners</h1><p>Businesses to know. Work to explore. Choices that stay yours.</p></header><div class="category-intro prose prose-stone max-w-none"><p>Sometimes a simpler day starts with finding the right help. Resource Partners is On Simplicity’s directory of independent businesses across a range of services and industries. Browse profiles to learn what a business does, where it works and how to contact it. Where available, recent project articles offer more detail about its services and approach. The directory is a starting point for your research, not a guarantee of availability, licensing or results. Check credentials, ask questions and agree on the scope of work directly with the business before booking. Read <a href="/about/">about our publication</a>, or explore the <a href="/category/house-home/">House & Home journal</a> for practical ideas while you plan your next step.</p></div>{postCategories.length>0&&<nav class="jump-links" aria-label="Business categories">{postCategories.map(c=><a href={`/resource-partners/category/${c.slug}/`}>{c.name}</a>)}</nav>}{page.items.length?<PartnerCards partners={page.items}/>:<div class="empty-state"><span class="eyebrow">Room for good connections</span><h2>The directory is taking shape.</h2><p>Business profiles will appear here when published. In the meantime, explore practical ideas from the journal.</p><a class="text-link" href="/archives/">Visit the archives ↗</a></div>}<Pagination current={page.number} total={page.total} base="/resource-partners/"/></Base>
